            "richtext_alignment": "left",
            "richtext_font": "Montserrat,sans-serif",
            "richtext": "<h2>Gift With Purchase (Online & InStore)</h2><p>The free gift with purchase (the “Gift with Purchase”) is available online and in-store with <strong>purchases of $2,000.00 USD or more</strong>, before taxes and shipping, and after any coupons or other discounts are applied, from October 27th, 2025 at 7:00AM PST to November 16th, 2025 at 11:59PM PST or while supplies last (the “Promotional Period”).</p><ul><li>Qualifying purchases will receive a 1/5 ctw Round Lab-Grown Diamond Sterling Silver Modern Interlocking Pendant with 18 Inch Adjustable Chain, valued at $495 USD.</li><li>Jewelry and Diamond certification is not included.</li><li>Offer cannot be applied to previous purchases.</li><li>The Gift with Purchase item is non-transferrable and may not be exchanged for cash or returned for refund.</li><li>Products purchased during the Promotion Period may be returned for a full refund in accordance with our Return Policy found at <a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/pages/returns\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">60 Days Return Policy </span></a>.</li><li>If an item from the qualifying order is returned, and the remaining order value is less than the qualifying purchase amount, then the Gift with Purchase must also be returned. If the Gift with Purchase is not returned, the retail value of the Gift with Purchase item(s) will be deducted from the refund.</li><li>The Gift with Purchase may ship separately.</li><li>MiaDonna reserves the right, without prior notice, to (i) discontinue the Gift with Purchase offer/promotion at any time; (ii) cancel or refuse any individual's benefit from it; (iii) amend these terms and conditions; and (iv) limit the number of promotional redemptions online or in-store. We are not able to offer rain checks on items that are out of stock.</li><li>The Gift with Purchase item will be shipped with your qualifying order, however, fulfillment times may vary during peak periods. To inquire about the status of your order, please Contact Us.</li><li>Except as otherwise set out herein, all purchases are subject to MiaDonna’s standard Terms and Conditions (which can be found at <a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/pages/terms-conditions\">Terms & Conditions</a> ) which are expressly incorporated herein by reference.</li><li>MiaDonna is not responsible for any technical or human errors in the administration of this Promotion. In the event of any discrepancy, MiaDonna’s decision will be final.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
