rder, please Contact Us.</li><li>Except as otherwise set out herein, all purchases are subject to MiaDonna’s standard Terms and Conditions (which can be found at <a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/pages/terms-conditions\">Terms & Conditions</a> ) which are expressly incorporated herein by reference.</li><li>MiaDonna is not responsible for any technical or human errors in the administration of this Promotion. In the event of any discrepancy, MiaDonna’s decision will be final.</li></ul>"
