        "richtext_Ngfkqf": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "richtext_alignment": "left",
            "richtext_font": "Montserrat,sans-serif",
            "richtext": "<h2>0% APR for up to 12 months (Online & InStore)</h2><p>Rates and terms only for checkouts completed between 10/1/2025 to 10/31/2025. Minimum purchase of $50.00 is required. Availability of terms may vary based on purchase price, product, and state of residence. Down payment may be required. Subject to approval of credit application. Rates range from 0% to 29.99% APR, resulting in, for example 36 monthly payments of $38.19 at 21.99% APR, per $1,000.00 borrowed. APRs will vary depending on credit qualifications, loan amount, and term. Bread Pay® loans are made by Comenity Capital Bank, a Bread Financial® company.</p>"
          }
        },
        "richtext_N3QYmM": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "richtext_alignment": "left",
            "richtext_font": "Montserrat,sans-serif",
            "richtext": "<h2>$100 off orders of $1,000+ (Email Subscribers)</h2><p>The $100 Off Discount (“Promotion”) is available online and in-store with purchases of $1,000.00 USD or more, before taxes and shipping, and after any other discounts have been applied. This offer is valid for customers who sign up to receive MiaDonna emails and/or SMS messages.</p><p>Qualifying subscribers will receive a unique coupon code to take $100 off their qualifying purchase of $1,000 or more.</p><p>Offer Details:</p><ul><li>The coupon must be redeemed within 30 days of signing up.</li><li>The Promotion cannot be applied to previous purchases.</li><li>The $100 Off Discount is non-transferable, has no cash value, and cannot be exchanged for cash or credit.</li><li>Products purchased using the $100 Off Discount may be returned for a full refund in accordance with our <a href=\"#\">60-Day Return Policy</a>.</li><li>If any item from a qualifying order is returned and the remaining order value falls below $1,000, the $100 discount amount will be deducted from the refund.</li><li>MiaDonna reserves the right, without prior notice, to (1) discontinue this Promotion at any time; (2) cancel or refuse any individual’s participation; (3) amend these Terms and Conditions; and/or (4) limit the number of promotional redemptions online or in-store.</li><li>Rain checks will not be offered on out-of-stock items.</li><li>Except as otherwise stated here, all purchases are subject to MiaDonna’s <a href=\"#\">standard Terms and Conditions</a>, which are incorporated herein by reference.</li><li>MiaDonna is not responsible for any technical or human errors in the administration of this Promotion. In the event of any discrepancy, MiaDonna’s decision shall be final.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
