          "settings": {
            "richtext_alignment": "left",
            "richtext_font": "Montserrat,sans-serif",
            "richtext": "<h2>Military & First Responder Discount</h2><p>MiaDonna offers a 10% discount on all orders to U.S. active duty military personnel, National Guard members, Reservists, veterans, retired personnel, and spouses. A 10% discount is also offered to Nurses and U.S. First Responders – policemen, firemen, EMTs, and paramedic personnel.</p><ul><li>To receive your Military, First Responder or Nurse discount, please click on the \"verify with ID.me\" button at checkout and go through the verification process. The MiaDonna Military, First Responder and Nurse discount is verified by ID.me.</li><li>Discount is not applicable to repairs, resizing, or services. </li><li>Discounts cannot be combined with any other discounts. </li><li>Offer cannot be applied to previous purchases.</li><li>Products purchased with this offer may be returned for a full refund in accordance with our Return Policy found at <a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/pages/returns\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">60 Days Return Policy </span></a>.</li><li>MiaDonna reserves the right, without prior notice, to (i) discontinue the offer at any time; (ii) cancel or refuse any individual's benefit from it; (iii) amend these terms and conditions; and (iv) limit the number of promotional redemptions online or in-store. We are not able to offer rain checks on items that are out of stock.</li><li>Except as otherwise set out herein, all purchases are subject to MiaDonna’s standard Terms and Conditions (which can be found at <a href=\"https://www.miadonna.com/pages/terms-conditions\">Terms & Conditions</a> ) which are expressly incorporated herein by reference.</li><li>MiaDonna is not responsible for any technical or human errors in the administration of this Promotion. In the event of any discrepancy, MiaDonna’s decision will be final.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
